// SPDX-License-Identifier: Apache-2.0
; T27 OS pty_logic: the decisions of the PTY server (pty_server.t27) that need no syscall -- pane slot
; allocation, pollfd packing, the status a hook or an exit gives, the command and argv a pane runs, the
; launchd plist. They live apart from the server because a module with @extern imports cannot run its
; tests (t27c needs two arguments for @extern; the JIT refuses imports), and a decision should run its tests.
; Refs gHashTag/t27#10782.
